  "$rules": [
    "Korean text is verbatim from Figma — keep typos ('자긴 전 대화') and inconsistent time formats ('8시 12분' vs '08시 00분' vs '23시 10분'). Do not fix.",
    "Images are referenced by file name in design-system/content/images/ (registry: manifest.json).",
    "No colors or alphas are recorded here — colours are design-system/tokens.json color roles (Figma values, per mode). Gradient values are geometry only (fractions of the text box width).",
    "Grid row/col are 1-based (matches rRcC in file names). Grid rows are row-major; a row may be shorter than columns (fills from the left).",
    "Keys starting with $ are documentation and are ignored by the generator.",
    "v5 typos are kept verbatim: 'Yurim님이 취침모드 전환로 전환했어요!', '자긴 전 대화', '08시 00분' (docs/v5-plan.md E4).",
    "v5 call-card icons follow the direction data (발신 = outgoing ↗ arrow-up-right, 수신 · 부재중 = arrow-down-left) — E4. The generator enforces icon ↔ direction. Figma's calls-only section draws the arrows swapped (CHANGES §7 Q4) — recorded in $figma only.",
    "v5 section tint = a tokens.json color role, heroGradient = a tokens.json gradient name (the generator checks both against tokens.json).",
    "v6 (key 'v6') is generic: objects · arrays of one shape · strings/numbers/booleans. String values that name an image must be in manifest.json; values under keys named icon / *Icon / *Icons / *Actions must be tokens.json icon.used keys (the generator checks both).",
    "v6 copy is verbatim, including the English lower-case tab labels ('history' · 'camera' · 'settings') and the placeholder times ('02:58', '오늘, 12시 00분'). '{partner}' in v6.connected.message is the only template (Figma 원문 'Yurim')."
  ],
